{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ed6109b1-056d-8708-9f5c-62af7cf9772c",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T11:36:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carol Tillinghast",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:35:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:35:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. This is Carol Tillinghast. Growing up down by the harbor, we always knew when the tide was high because the water came up through the street grates. Anyway, that's not why I'm calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:35:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, go ahead, Carol. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:35:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a storm drain in front of my house, and since last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday, it's been gurgling. And a sewer smell comes up out of it. Wicked strong, especially in the afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:35:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not pleasant. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:35:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "287 Ruggles Avenue, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:35:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "287 Ruggles Avenue, Historic Hill. And it's the drain right at the curb out front?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:36:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, right at the curb. My neighbor says it does this every big rain. So it's not new, apparently. Somebody should've looked at it a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:36:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds like it's been a repeat problem. So you want it checked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:36:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Who do I call to get somebody to look at it? Is that you, or is it somebody else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:36:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's us. I'll put in a request for a crew to inspect that drain. Can I confirm a callback number, 401-555-0180?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:36:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:36:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I've got the gurgling, the sewer smell, 287 Ruggles. Someone will follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:36:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. I hope somebody actually comes this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:36:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that. Take care, Carol."
    }
  ],
